{
  "displayName": "Vertex AI Agent Engine ADK Agent Efficiency",
  "dashboardFilters": [
    {
      "filterType": "RESOURCE_LABEL",
      "labelKey": "job",
      "templateVariable": "agent",
      "valueType": "STRING"
    }
  ],
  "labels": {},
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 48,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "height": 12,
        "width": 48,
        "widget": {
          "text": {
            "content": "**ADK agent efficiency.** Pick the agent with the **agent** filter (on Agent Engine, the reasoning engine ID). Scorecards and donuts cover the selected time range. Charts show a mean per time step unless the title says p95.\n\n**What a tile needs** (only ADK Python emits these metrics)\n- Unmarked: ADK 2.8.0+ exporting metrics to Cloud Monitoring, with telemetry schema v2 (the default from 2.13.0, and on Agent Engine before that).\n- Cache-read ratio, reasoning share and token type tiles: ADK 2.14.0+, or the opt-in below on older versions.\n- **(opt-in)**: experimental `adk.experimental.*` metrics. ADK 2.10.0+ with `ADK_EXPERIMENTAL_TELEMETRY=true`, then redeploy. Names may change.\n\nA **turn** is one user message through to the final response. An **agent invocation** is one run of one agent in a turn.",
            "format": "MARKDOWN",
            "style": {}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "height": 8,
        "width": 8,
        "widget": {
          "scorecard": {
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "prometheusQuery": "sum(rate({\"__name__\"=\"gen_ai.client.token.usage_sum\",\"job\"=~\"${agent.value}\"}[${__interval}])) / sum(rate({\"__name__\"=\"gen_ai.invoke_workflow.duration_count\",\"job\"=~\"${agent.value}\",\"gen_ai.workflow.nested\"=\"\"}[${__interval}]))",
              "outputFullDuration": true,
              "unitOverride": "1"
            }
          },
          "title": "Tokens per turn"
        },
        "yPos": 12
      },
      {
        "height": 8,
        "width": 8,
        "widget": {
          "scorecard": {
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "prometheusQuery": "(sum(rate({\"__name__\"=\"gen_ai.client.inference.usage.cache_read.input_tokens\",\"job\"=~\"${agent.value}\"}[${__interval}])) or sum(rate({\"__name__\"=\"adk.experimental.invoke_workflow.cache_read.input_tokens_sum\",\"job\"=~\"${agent.value}\",\"gen_ai.workflow.nested\"=\"\"}[${__interval}]))) / (sum(rate({\"__name__\"=\"gen_ai.client.inference.usage.input_tokens\",\"job\"=~\"${agent.value}\"}[${__interval}])) or sum(rate({\"__name__\"=\"adk.experimental.invoke_workflow.input_tokens_sum\",\"job\"=~\"${agent.value}\",\"gen_ai.workflow.nested\"=\"\"}[${__interval}])))",
              "outputFullDuration": true,
              "unitOverride": "10^2.%"
            }
          },
          "title": "Cache-read ratio"
        },
        "xPos": 8,
        "yPos": 12
      },
